 far.","locale":"en"},"237":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-36","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#what-the-gateway-shows","content":"**Last packet**","locale":"en"},"238":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-37","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#what-the-gateway-shows","content":"The last packet received, in readable form.","locale":"en"},"239":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-38","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#what-the-gateway-shows","content":"The gateway listens all the time and **remembers every device** it hears, also after a Homey restart. That's why Homey\ncan show a list right away when you add a unit, remote or sensor.","locale":"en"},"240":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-39","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"Situation","locale":"en"},"241":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-40","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"What you see","locale":"en"},"242":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-41","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"Homey is still connecting to the broker","locale":"en"},"243":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-42","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"*Connecting to the MQTT broker…*","locale":"en"},"244":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-43","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"The broker cannot be reached","locale":"en"},"245":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-44","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"Device unavailable: *MQTT broker not reachable*. Homey keeps retrying.","locale":"en"},"246":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-45","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"Wrong user name or password","locale":"en"},"247":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-46","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"*The MQTT broker refused the user name or password.* Change them in the settings.","locale":"en"},"248":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-47","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"The ramses_esp reports offline","locale":"en"},"249":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-48","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#availability","content":"*The ramses_esp reports that it is offline. Check its power and WiFi.*","locale":"en"},"250":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-49","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#settings","content":"Under *Device → Settings* you can change the broker details later (host, port, user, password, TLS). After saving, the\ngateway reconnects. The gateway address is for information only.","locale":"en"},"251":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-50","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#several-gateways","content":"You can add more than one ramses_esp, for example when your home is too large for one radio. Every ventilation unit,\nremote and sensor remembers the gateway it was found through and also sends its commands through that gateway.","locale":"en"},"252":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-51","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#gateway-flow-cards","content":"The gateway has cards for advanced use: reacting to any packet on the bus, sending raw frames and knowing whether the\ngateway is online. See Flows → Gateway.","locale":"en"},"253":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-52","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"Message while searching","locale":"en"},"254":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-53","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"Solution","locale":"en"},"255":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-54","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"*No MQTT broker answered at this address.*","locale":"en"},"256":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-55","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"Check IP address and port, and that the broker app is running.","locale":"en"},"257":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-56","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"*The broker refused the user name or password.*","locale":"en"},"258":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-57","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"Check the credentials in the broker app.","locale":"en"},"259":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-58","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"*Connected, but no ramses_esp published anything on this broker.*","locale":"en"},"260":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-59","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"The ramses_esp is not connected to this broker. Check its MQTT settings, or enter its address (`18:xxxxxx`) under *Gateway address*.","locale":"en"},"261":{"id":"/en/docs/gateway-60","page_id":"/en/docs/gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/gateway#when-it-doesnt-work","content":"More in Troubleshooting.","locale":"en"},"262":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","type":"page","content":"Virtual CO₂ sensor","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Devices"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","locale":"en"},"263":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-0","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","content":"Let your ventilation unit respond to any CO₂ or humidity sensor in Homey, as if it were an original RAMSES sensor.","locale":"en"},"264":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-1","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#why","content":"Why?","locale":"en"},"265":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-2","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#adding-and-binding","content":"Adding and binding","locale":"en"},"266":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-3","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-binding-looks-like-on-the-bus","content":"What binding looks like on the bus","locale":"en"},"267":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-4","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"Passing on values with flows","locale":"en"},"268":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-5","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"Calculating the ventilation demand","locale":"en"},"269":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-6","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"What the sensor shows","locale":"en"},"270":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-7","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#why","content":"A unit in **auto mode** ventilates harder as its sensors ask for more. But maybe you already have a Netatmo, Aqara,\nAirthings or Zigbee sensor in the bedroom and no RAMSES sensor. With the **Virtual CO₂ sensor**, Homey itself plays a\nRAMSES CO₂ sensor (`37:xxxxxx`) and forwards the values of your Homey sensors to the unit. The unit then regulates\nitself, in its own auto mode.","locale":"en"},"271":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-8","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#why","content":"Not to be confused with a **Room sensor**. A real RAMSES sensor such as the Orcon CO2 15RF is added as a Room sensor. The\nvirtual sensor has no measurement of its own: its tiles show *–* until a flow passes it a value.","locale":"en"},"272":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-9","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#adding-and-binding","content":"Go to **Devices → + → RAMSES ESP → Virtual CO₂ sensor**. Homey picks a free address on the bus.","locale":"en"},"273":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-10","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#adding-and-binding","content":"Put the unit in **binding mode** (Orcon: unplug and plug back in; you then have 2 minutes).","locale":"en"},"274":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-11","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#adding-and-binding","content":"Open the Virtual CO₂ sensor → **Settings** → **Maintenance** → **Bind to a unit**.","locale":"en"},"275":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-12","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#adding-and-binding","content":"Homey offers itself as a sensor (see below). Once accepted, the unit's address is shown under\n*Bound to unit*.","locale":"en"},"276":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-13","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#adding-and-binding","content":"Homey sends two offers in turn, every 5 seconds: first as a *control*, like an Orcon CO2 15RF, then as a *plain\nsensor* (`31E0`, `1298`, `2E10`). The unit accepts the one it knows. Orcon units accept the first; other brands\nmay accept the second. Only Orcon has been verified so far.","locale":"en"},"277":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-14","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-binding-looks-like-on-the-bus","content":"Verified on an Orcon VMC-15RP01 that already had a CO2 15RF bound. Homey plays sensor `37:215483`, the unit is\n`29:233244`:","locale":"en"},"278":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-15","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-binding-looks-like-on-the-bus","content":"The unit answered within a second of the first offer. Right after, Homey's reports reach the unit:","locale":"en"},"279":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-16","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-binding-looks-like-on-the-bus","content":"The demand goes in the **first** group of the `31E0` (`00 00 DD 00`), in half percent. An Orcon CO2 15RF raises\nand lowers that group with the CO₂ level; the second group (`01 00 DD 00`) does not drive the unit. Version 1.0.0\nput the demand only in the second group, and the unit did not respond: verified with 100 % in either form on the\nsame unit.","locale":"en"},"280":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-17","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-binding-looks-like-on-the-bus","content":"You can follow this yourself in the bus view. Only the unit you expect should answer with the\n`W 1FC9`; a neighbour's unit only does when it is in binding mode at the same moment.","locale":"en"},"281":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-18","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-binding-looks-like-on-the-bus","content":"A unit remembers bound devices. Unbinding usually means resetting all bindings on the unit (see its manual) and\nthen binding your other remotes and sensors again. The existing sensors stay bound when you add the virtual sensor.","locale":"en"},"282":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-19","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"The sensor has three action cards:","locale":"en"},"283":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-20","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"Card","locale":"en"},"284":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-21","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"285":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-22","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"**Report \\[ppm] ppm CO₂**","locale":"en"},"286":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-23","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"Sends a CO₂ value (`1298`) to the unit.","locale":"en"},"287":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-24","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"**Report \\[%] % humidity**","locale":"en"},"288":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-25","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"Sends a humidity (`12A0`) to the unit.","locale":"en"},"289":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-26","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"**Ask the unit for \\[%] % ventilation**","locale":"en"},"290":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-27","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"Sends a ventilation demand (`31E0`) directly.","locale":"en"},"291":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-28","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"A typical flow:","locale":"en"},"292":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-29","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"> **When** the CO₂ of *Netatmo bedroom* changed\n> **Then** *Virtual CO₂ sensor*: Report **\\[CO₂ token]** ppm CO₂","locale":"en"},"293":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-30","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"Do the same for the humidity of, for example, the bathroom sensor.","locale":"en"},"294":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-31","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#passing-on-values-with-flows","content":"Homey **repeats the last values every 5 minutes**, as a real sensor does. So if no new value arrives for a while, the\nunit doesn't consider the sensor gone.","locale":"en"},"295":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-32","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"Under *Settings → Ventilation demand* you decide how the sensor calculates its demand.","locale":"en"},"296":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-33","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"297":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-34","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"298":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-35","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"299":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-36","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"**Derive from CO₂ and humidity**","locale":"en"},"300":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-37","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"on","locale":"en"},"301":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-38","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"Homey calculates the ventilation demand itself from the reported values. Off: only the card *Ask for ventilation* sets the demand.","locale":"en"},"302":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-39","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"**CO₂ from**","locale":"en"},"303":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-40","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"400 ppm","locale":"en"},"304":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-41","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"Below this value the demand is 0 %.","locale":"en"},"305":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-42","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"**CO₂ full demand at**","locale":"en"},"306":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-43","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#calculating-the-ventilation-demand","content":"1000 ppm","locale":"en"},"307":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-44","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2