− 400) = **50 %**. 65 % humidity gives\n(65 − 60) / (80 − 60) = **25 %**. The sensor therefore asks for 50 %.","locale":"en"},"316":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-53","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"Capability","locale":"en"},"317":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-54","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"CO₂","locale":"en"},"318":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-55","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"The last reported CO₂","locale":"en"},"319":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-56","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"Humidity","locale":"en"},"320":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-57","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"The last reported humidity","locale":"en"},"321":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-58","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"Ventilation demand","locale":"en"},"322":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-59","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"What the sensor is asking the unit for now","locale":"en"},"323":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-60","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"Under *Settings → Bus* you find the address Homey plays and the unit the sensor is bound to.","locale":"en"},"324":{"id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor-61","page_id":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/homey-co2-sensor#what-the-sensor-shows","content":"The unit has to be in **Auto** to respond to the ventilation demand. Set it to low or high manually and it ignores\nsensors until you set it back.","locale":"en"},"325":{"id":"/en/docs","page_id":"/en/docs","type":"page","content":"Overview","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs","locale":"en"},"326":{"id":"/en/docs-0","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs","content":"Let your home ventilation respond to CO₂, humidity and your daily routine.","locale":"en"},"327":{"id":"/en/docs-1","page_id":"/en/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"What does the app do?","locale":"en"},"328":{"id":"/en/docs-2","page_id":"/en/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs#how-it-fits-together","content":"How it fits together","locale":"en"},"329":{"id":"/en/docs-3","page_id":"/en/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs#quick-overview","content":"Quick overview","locale":"en"},"330":{"id":"/en/docs-4","page_id":"/en/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Supported devices","locale":"en"},"331":{"id":"/en/docs-5","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"Many ventilation systems talk to each other wirelessly on **868 MHz** using the **RAMSES II** protocol: the unit in\nthe attic, the remote in the kitchen, the CO₂ sensor in the living room. A\nramses_esp is a small ESP32 stick with an 868 MHz radio that listens to\nthat traffic and can send messages itself. It forwards everything to an **MQTT broker**.","locale":"en"},"332":{"id":"/en/docs-6","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"This Homey app connects to that broker and turns what happens on the bus into regular Homey devices:","locale":"en"},"333":{"id":"/en/docs-7","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"In Homey","locale":"en"},"334":{"id":"/en/docs-8","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"What you can do","locale":"en"},"335":{"id":"/en/docs-9","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"**Ramses Gateway**","locale":"en"},"336":{"id":"/en/docs-10","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"The link to your ramses_esp. Sees every packet on the bus and remembers every device it hears.","locale":"en"},"337":{"id":"/en/docs-11","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"**Ventilation unit**","locale":"en"},"338":{"id":"/en/docs-12","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"Choose the mode (low, medium, high, auto, away), boost, bypass, filter counter, sensors and parameters.","locale":"en"},"339":{"id":"/en/docs-13","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"**Remote**","locale":"en"},"340":{"id":"/en/docs-14","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"Every button press on a physical remote becomes a flow trigger.","locale":"en"},"341":{"id":"/en/docs-15","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"**Room sensor**","locale":"en"},"342":{"id":"/en/docs-16","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"CO₂, humidity, temperature and battery of room sensors.","locale":"en"},"343":{"id":"/en/docs-17","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"**Virtual CO₂ sensor**","locale":"en"},"344":{"id":"/en/docs-18","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"Homey poses as a CO₂ sensor and binds to your unit like a real one, so the unit responds to *any* sensor in your home.","locale":"en"},"345":{"id":"/en/docs-19","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-does-the-app-do","content":"You also get a **dashboard widget** and a **bus view** with live traffic, a device finder and a form to send frames\nyourself.","locale":"en"},"346":{"id":"/en/docs-20","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#how-it-fits-together","content":"No **Home Assistant**, no extra server and no reflashing of the ramses_esp needed. The app runs entirely locally on\nyour Homey.","locale":"en"},"347":{"id":"/en/docs-21","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#quick-overview","content":"Set up the ramses_esp and an MQTT broker (e.g. the *MQTT Broker* app on Homey).","locale":"en"},"348":{"id":"/en/docs-22","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#quick-overview","content":"Install the app on your Homey.","locale":"en"},"349":{"id":"/en/docs-23","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#quick-overview","content":"Add the gateway: enter the broker address, Homey finds the ramses_esp by itself.","locale":"en"},"350":{"id":"/en/docs-24","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#quick-overview","content":"Add your ventilation unit and make sure Homey may control it\n(through the address of a bound remote, or by binding Homey itself).","locale":"en"},"351":{"id":"/en/docs-25","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#quick-overview","content":"Optional: remotes and sensors, the Virtual CO₂ sensor and\nflows.","locale":"en"},"352":{"id":"/en/docs-26","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"The app speaks RAMSES II, the protocol these brands share. Brands do number their modes differently; the app\ndetects this by itself, or you choose the brand in the settings.","locale":"en"},"353":{"id":"/en/docs-27","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Brand","locale":"en"},"354":{"id":"/en/docs-28","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Status","locale":"en"},"355":{"id":"/en/docs-29","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"**Orcon** (MVS-15, HRC, CO2 15RF, 15RF remotes)","locale":"en"},"356":{"id":"/en/docs-30","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Tested on a real installation","locale":"en"},"357":{"id":"/en/docs-31","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"**Itho Daalderop** (CVE, HRU with RFT remotes)","locale":"en"},"358":{"id":"/en/docs-32","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Based on the tables of ramses_rf","locale":"en"},"359":{"id":"/en/docs-33","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"**Vasco** (D series)","locale":"en"},"360":{"id":"/en/docs-34","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Based on the tables of ramses_rf","locale":"en"},"361":{"id":"/en/docs-35","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"**ClimaRad** (Ventura)","locale":"en"},"362":{"id":"/en/docs-36","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Based on the tables of ramses_rf","locale":"en"},"363":{"id":"/en/docs-37","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"**Nuaire**","locale":"en"},"364":{"id":"/en/docs-38","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Medium and high only","locale":"en"},"365":{"id":"/en/docs-39","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#supported-devices","content":"Does your unit beha