Homey usually finds it by itself.","locale":"en"},"483":{"id":"/en/docs/installation-115","page_id":"/en/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/installation#topics","content":"Want to check that the ramses_esp publishes before installing the app? Subscribe to `RAMSES/#` with an MQTT client\nsuch as MQTT Explorer. Within a minute you'll see traffic from your unit, your sensors\nand, in an apartment building, your neighbours too.","locale":"en"},"484":{"id":"/en/docs/installation-116","page_id":"/en/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/installation#3-installing-the-app","content":"The app is available as a **test version** in the Homey App Store. Install it with one click:","locale":"en"},"485":{"id":"/en/docs/installation-117","page_id":"/en/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/installation#3-installing-the-app","content":"Install RAMSES ESP on your Homey","locale":"en"},"486":{"id":"/en/docs/installation-118","page_id":"/en/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/installation#3-installing-the-app","content":"Open the link above and sign in with your Homey account.","locale":"en"},"487":{"id":"/en/docs/installation-119","page_id":"/en/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/installation#3-installing-the-app","content":"Click **Install** and choose your Homey.","locale":"en"},"488":{"id":"/en/docs/installation-120","page_id":"/en/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/installation#3-installing-the-app","content":"After a few seconds the app is listed under *Apps* on your Homey.","locale":"en"},"489":{"id":"/en/docs/installation-121","page_id":"/en/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/installation#3-installing-the-app","content":"You don't need a computer, Node.js or the Homey CLI.","locale":"en"},"490":{"id":"/en/docs/installation-122","page_id":"/en/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/installation#3-ins