docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/nl/docs/installation#3-de-app-installeren","content":"3\\. De app installeren","locale":"nl"},"1275":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-13","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/nl/docs/installation#4-apparaten-toevoegen","content":"4\\. Apparaten toevoegen","locale":"nl"},"1276":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-14","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"Onderdeel","locale":"nl"},"1277":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-15","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"Toelichting","locale":"nl"},"1278":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-16","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"**Homey Pro (2023)** of **Homey Pro mini**","locale":"nl"},"1279":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-17","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"Firmware **12.4 of nieuwer**. De app draait lokaal; Homey Cloud wordt niet ondersteund.","locale":"nl"},"1280":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-18","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"**ramses_esp**","locale":"nl"},"1281":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-19","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"Een ESP32 met 868 MHz-radio en de ramses_esp-firmware, verbonden met je wifi. Zie welke gateway voor boards die je kunt kopen.","locale":"nl"},"1282":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-20","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"**MQTT-broker**","locale":"nl"},"1283":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-21","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"Waar de ramses_esp naartoe publiceert. Het makkelijkst is de *MQTT Broker*-app op Homey zelf; Mosquitto op een NAS of Raspberry Pi werkt net zo goed.","locale":"nl"},"1284":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-22","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"**Een RAMSES II-ventilatiesysteem**","locale":"nl"},"1285":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-23","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"Orcon, Itho, Vasco, ClimaRad of Nuaire op 868 MHz.","locale":"nl"},"1286":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-24","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wat-heb-je-nodig","content":"Plaats de ramses_esp ergens tussen je Homey-wifi en de ventilatie-unit in. 868 MHz komt goed door muren, maar een\nzolder met een betonvloer ertussen kan net te veel zijn. De busweergave laat de\nsignaalsterkte (RSSI) van elk pakket zien.","locale":"nl"},"1287":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-25","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"Deze boards zijn getest met de app. Beide worden geleverd met de juiste firmware, dus je stelt alleen wifi en MQTT in\n(stap 2 hieronder).","locale":"nl"},"1288":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-26","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"Board","locale":"nl"},"1289":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-27","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"Chip","locale":"nl"},"1290":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-28","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"Firmware","locale":"nl"},"1291":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-29","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"Waar","locale":"nl"},"1292":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-30","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"**Elecram Sub-GHz 855–925 MHz Bridge**","locale":"nl"},"1293":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-31","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"ESP32-C6 + TI CC1101","locale":"nl"},"1294":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-32","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"ramses_esp voor ESP32-C6 (meldt zich als `ramses_esp_c6`)","locale":"nl"},"1295":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-33","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"elecram.com. Bestel de 868 MHz-antenne erbij.","locale":"nl"},"1296":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-34","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"**Indalo-Tech RAMSES_ESP**","locale":"nl"},"1297":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-35","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"ESP32-S3 + TI CC1101","locale":"nl"},"1298":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-36","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"ramses_esp (meldt zich als `ramses_esp`)","locale":"nl"},"1299":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-37","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"indalotech.co.uk, als de winkel open is.","locale":"nl"},"1300":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-38","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#welke-gateway","content":"De app leest beide firmwares op dezelfde manier: hij vindt gateways aan hun MQTT-topics, niet aan de naam van de\nfirmware. Het Elecram-board heeft bij het instellen een paar extra aandachtspunten; zie\nElecram ESP32-C6-board.","locale":"nl"},"1301":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-39","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#1-de-mqtt-broker","content":"De ramses_esp en Homey praten niet rechtstreeks met elkaar, maar via een MQTT-broker.","locale":"nl"},"1302":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-40","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#optie-a-de-mqtt-broker-app-op-homey-aanbevolen","content":"Installeer de app **MQTT Broker** uit de Homey App Store.","locale":"nl"},"1303":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-41","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#optie-a-de-mqtt-broker-app-op-homey-aanbevolen","content":"Open *Apps → MQTT Broker → Instellen* en controleer dat de broker op poort **1883** luistert.","locale":"nl"},"1304":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-42","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#optie-a-de-mqtt-broker-app-op-homey-aanbevolen","content":"Maak een gebruiker aan (aanbevolen) en noteer gebruikersnaam en wachtwoord.","locale":"nl"},"1305":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-43","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#optie-a-de-mqtt-broker-app-op-homey-aanbevolen","content":"Noteer het **IP-adres van je Homey** (*Instellingen → Algemeen → Over*). Dat is straks het brokeradres.","locale":"nl"},"1306":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-44","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#optie-a-de-mqtt-broker-app-op-homey-aanbevolen","content":"Geef je Homey een vast IP-adres in je router (DHCP-reservering). Verandert het adres, dan verliest de ramses_esp\nde verbinding met de broker.","locale":"nl"},"1307":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-45","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#optie-b-een-bestaande-broker","content":"Gebruik je al Mosquitto (bijvoorbeeld van een oude Home Assistant-installatie)? Dan kun je die gewoon houden.\nZorg alleen dat Homey de broker kan bereiken en dat je de gebruikersnaam en het wachtwoord hebt. TLS (`mqtts`) wordt\nondersteund.","locale":"nl"},"1308":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-46","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#2-de-ramses_esp-instellen","content":"Homey kan niet via USB-serial met de stick praten, dus de ramses_esp moet via **wifi** naar de MQTT-broker. Dat stel\nje **één keer** in via de seriële console. Daarna heeft de stick alleen nog stroom nodig: een USB-lader of een vrije\nUSB-poort volstaat.","locale":"nl"},"1309":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-47","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#2-de-ramses_esp-instellen","content":"**Kom je van Home Assistant?** Daar hing de stick meestal via USB-serial aan de Raspberry Pi. Haal hem eruit en\nconfigureer hem zoals hieronder. Je ramses_cc-configuratie heb je daarna niet meer nodig, maar bewaar het\n*FAN ID* en het remote-adres: die heb je straks in Homey nodig.","locale":"nl"},"1310":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-48","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#seriële-console-openen","content":"Stop de ramses_esp in een pc met Windows, macOS of Linux.","locale":"nl"},"1311":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-49","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#seriële-console-openen","content":"Open een seriële terminal op de juiste poort met **115200 baud**:","locale":"nl"},"1312":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-50","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#seriële-console-openen","content":"**Windows**: PuTTY, verbindingstype *Serial*. De COM-poort vind je in\n*Apparaatbeheer → Poorten (COM & LPT)*. Stel PuTTY in zoals hieronder voordat je op *Open* klikt.","locale":"nl"},"1313":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-51","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#seriële-console-openen","content":"**macOS / Linux**: bijvoorbeeld `screen /dev/ttyUSB0 115200` (op macOS iets als `/dev/tty.usbserial-…`).","locale":"nl"},"1314":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-52","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#seriële-console-openen","content":"Druk op **Enter**. Je krijgt de prompt van de ramses_esp.","locale":"nl"},"1315":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-53","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Waar in PuTTY","locale":"nl"},"1316":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-54","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Instelling","locale":"nl"},"1317":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-55","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Waarom","locale":"nl"},"1318":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-56","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"*Session*","locale":"nl"},"1319":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-57","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Connection type **Serial**, serial line **COM…**, speed **115200**","locale":"nl"},"1320":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-58","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"De poort van het board.","locale":"nl"},"1321":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-59","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"*Connection → Serial*","locale":"nl"},"1322":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-60","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Flow control **None**","locale":"nl"},"1323":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-61","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Met de standaard *XON/XOFF* krijgt het board niets binnen van wat je typt.","locale":"nl"},"1324":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-62","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"*Terminal*","locale":"nl"},"1325":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-63","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"**Implicit CR in every LF** aan","locale":"nl"},"1326":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-64","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Regels beginnen links in plaats van als een trap naar beneden te lopen.","locale":"nl"},"1327":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-65","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"*Terminal*","locale":"nl"},"1328":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-66","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Local echo **Force on**, local line editing **Force on**","locale":"nl"},"1329":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-67","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Je ziet wat je typt en kunt het verbeteren vóór *Enter*.","locale":"nl"},"1330":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-68","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#putty-instellingen","content":"Sla dit op onder een naam op de pagina *Session*, dan open je het de volgende keer met een dubbelklik. Sluit PuTTY\nvoordat je het board flasht: maar één programma tegelijk kan de COM-poort gebruiken.","locale":"nl"},"1331":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-69","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Typ de commando's één voor één. Ze zijn **hoofdlettergevoelig**.","locale":"nl"},"1332":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-70","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Commando","locale":"nl"},"1333":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-71","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Wat het doet","locale":"nl"},"1334":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-72","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"`wifi password` / `wifi ssid`","locale":"nl"},"1335":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-73","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Het wachtwoord en de naam van je wifinetwerk. Gebruik een **2,4 GHz**-netwerk; een ESP32 ondersteunt geen 5 GHz.","locale":"nl"},"1336":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-74","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"`wifi restart`","locale":"nl"},"1337":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-75","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Verbindt opnieuw met de nieuwe wifigegevens.","locale":"nl"},"1338":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-76","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"`mqtt user` / `mqtt password`","locale":"nl"},"1339":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-77","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"De gebruiker die je in de broker-app hebt aangemaakt. Laat weg als je broker geen inlog vraagt.","locale":"nl"},"1340":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-78","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"`mqtt broker`","locale":"nl"},"1341":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-79","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Het adres van de broker. Met de MQTT Broker-app is dat `mqtt://<IP van je Homey>:1883`.","locale":"nl"},"1342":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-80","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"`sntp server` / `timezone`","locale":"nl"},"1343":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-81","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Tijdsynchronisatie, zodat de tijdstempels in de berichten kloppen.","locale":"nl"},"1344":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-82","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"`reset`","locale":"nl"},"1345":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-83","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Herstart de ramses_esp met de nieuwe instellingen.","locale":"nl"},"1346":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-84","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"**Zet het wachtwoord altijd vóór de ssid- of brokerregel.** Zodra de ramses_esp een ssid of broker krijgt, probeert\nhij meteen te verbinden. Staat het wachtwoord er dan nog niet in, dan mislukt die eerste poging.","locale":"nl"},"1347":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-85","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Na de `reset` verbindt de stick met je wifi en de broker. Je kunt hem dan loskoppelen van de pc en ergens anders aan\nde stroom hangen, het liefst halverwege je Homey-wifi en de ventilatie-unit.","locale":"nl"},"1348":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-86","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#wifi-en-mqtt-instellen","content":"Meer commando's en firmware-updates staan in de documentatie van ramses_esp.","locale":"nl"},"1349":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-87","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"Het Elecram-board kent dezelfde commando's, met deze verschillen:","locale":"nl"},"1350":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-88","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"Punt","locale":"nl"},"1351":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-89","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"Wat je doet","locale":"nl"},"1352":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-90","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"**Netwerkmodus**","locale":"nl"},"1353":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-91","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"De firmware kan via wifi of Zigbee werken; MQTT werkt alleen in wifimodus. Typ `network show`. Staat er `zigbee`, typ dan `network wifi`; het board slaat dat op en herstart.","locale":"nl"},"1354":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-92","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"**Brokeradres**","locale":"nl"},"1355":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-93","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"Typ het volledig, met `mqtt://` en de poort: `mqtt broker mqtt://192.168.1.20:1883`.","locale":"nl"},"1356":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-94","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"**MQTT-inlog wijzigen**","locale":"nl"},"1357":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-95","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"Typ `reset` na `mqtt user` en `mqtt password`. Tot die tijd blijft het board het opnieuw proberen met de oude inlog en toont de console steeds `MQTT: Disonnected`.","locale":"nl"},"1358":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-96","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"**Tijd**","locale":"nl"},"1359":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-97","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"De firmware heeft standaard geen tijdserver, dus de tijdstempels staan op `1970-01-01`. Stel er een in met `sntp server pool.ntp.org` en een tijdzone, bijvoorbeeld `timezone CET-1CEST,M3.5.0,M10.5.0/3` (Amsterdam met zomertijd), en dan `reset`. Homey gebruikt de tijdstempels niet, dus dit is optioneel.","locale":"nl"},"1360":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-98","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"Als het werkt, toont de console:","locale":"nl"},"1361":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-99","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"In MQTT Explorer verschijnt het board als `RAMSES/GATEWAY/18:xxxxxx = online` met `info/firmware = ramses_esp_c6`.","locale":"nl"},"1362":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-100","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#elecram-esp32-c6-board","content":"**Via Zigbee in plaats van wifi (experimenteel, niet getest).** In Zigbee-modus kan het board aan\nZigbee2MQTT worden gekoppeld. De fork heeft een Zigbee2MQTT-extensie (branch\n`z2m_support`, `z2m/external_extensions/ramses-esp-bridge.mjs`) die de pakketten doorgeeft op dezelfde\n`RAMSES/GATEWAY/18:xxxxxx/rx`- en `/tx`-topics, zodat de app ze gewoon kan lezen. Zigbee2MQTT moet dan dezelfde broker\ngebruiken als Homey. De extensie zit nog niet in een release en heeft ook de apparaatdefinitie van het board in\nZigbee2MQTT nodig. Via Zigbee is er geen online/offline-statustopic, dus de online-kaart en de offline-melding van de\ngateway werken niet. Gebruik wifi, tenzij je wilt experimenteren.","locale":"nl"},"1363":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-101","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"Als het goed is, publiceert de ramses_esp daarna op deze topics:","locale":"nl"},"1364":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-102","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"Topic","locale":"nl"},"1365":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-103","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"Richting","locale":"nl"},"1366":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-104","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"Inhoud","locale":"nl"},"1367":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-105","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"`RAMSES/GATEWAY/<id>`","locale":"nl"},"1368":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-106","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"ramses_esp → broker","locale":"nl"},"1369":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-107","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"Online/offline-status (ook als *last will*)","locale":"nl"},"1370":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-108","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"`RAMSES/GATEWAY/<id>/rx`","locale":"nl"},"1371":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-109","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"ramses_esp → broker","locale":"nl"},"1372":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-110","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"Elk pakket dat de radio hoort, als `{\"msg\": \"<frame>\"}`","locale":"nl"},"1373":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-111","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"`RAMSES/GATEWAY/<id>/tx`","locale":"nl"},"1374":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-112","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"broker → ramses_esp","locale":"nl"},"1375":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-113","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"Frames die de ramses_esp moet versturen","locale":"nl"},"1376":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-114","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"`<id>` is het eigen adres van de ramses_esp, iets als `18:203612`. Dat zie je in de ramses_esp zelf en in de\ntopics; Homey vindt het meestal vanzelf.","locale":"nl"},"1377":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-115","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#topics","content":"Wil je controleren of de ramses_esp publiceert voordat je de app installeert? Abonneer met een MQTT-client zoals\nMQTT Explorer op `RAMSES/#`. Je hoort dan binnen een minuut verkeer van je unit,\nje sensoren en, in een appartementencomplex, ook van de buren.","locale":"nl"},"1378":{"id":"/nl/docs/installation-116","page_id":"/nl/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/installation#3-de-app-installeren","content":"De app staat als **testversie** in de Homey App Store. Je installee