,"page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#ruimtesensor","content":"Batterij, Batterij bijna leeg","locale":"nl"},"1564":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-35","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#ruimtesensor","content":"`1060`","locale":"nl"},"1565":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-36","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#ruimtesensor","content":"Ook hier verschijnen alleen de capabilities die de sensor echt meldt.","locale":"nl"},"1566":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-37","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#toevoegen-1","content":"Ga naar **Apparaten → + → RAMSES ESP → Ruimtesensor**.","locale":"nl"},"1567":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-38","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#toevoegen-1","content":"Sensoren melden zich om de paar minuten. Wil je dat de jouwe zich meteen meldt, druk dan op een knop of zet hem\nin een andere stand (bv. van 1 naar 2, of naar auto).","locale":"nl"},"1568":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-39","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#toevoegen-1","content":"Kies de sensor en voeg hem toe.","locale":"nl"},"1569":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-40","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#sensoren-met-knoppen","content":"Sommige sensoren zijn tegelijk een bediening. De Orcon CO2 15RF heeft bijvoorbeeld knoppen voor *Auto* en *Hoog*.\nDaarvoor zijn er dezelfde triggers als bij de remote:","locale":"nl"},"1570":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-41","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#sensoren-met-knoppen","content":"**De knop \\[…] werd ingedrukt**","locale":"nl"},"1571":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-42","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#sensoren-met-knoppen","content":"**Een willekeurige knop werd ingedrukt**","locale":"nl"},"1572":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-43","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#naamgeving","content":"Nieuwe apparaten heten *Afstandsbediening 29:123456* of *Ruimtesensor 37:044778*. Hernoem ze naar iets herkenbaars\n(*Remote keuken*, *CO₂ woonkamer*). Het adres blijft zichtbaar onder *Instellingen → Bus*.","locale":"nl"},"1573":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-44","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"Elk RAMSES-apparaat heeft een adres `TT:NNNNNN`. De eerste twee cijfers zeggen iets over het soort apparaat:","locale":"nl"},"1574":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-45","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"Begint met","locale":"nl"},"1575":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-46","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"Meestal","locale":"nl"},"1576":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-47","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"`18:`","locale":"nl"},"1577":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-48","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"Gateway (ramses_esp, HGI80)","locale":"nl"},"1578":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-49","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"`29:`","locale":"nl"},"1579":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-50","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"Afstandsbediening, of een Orcon-unit","locale":"nl"},"1580":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-51","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"`32:`","locale":"nl"},"1581":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-52","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"Ventilatie-unit (Itho, Vasco, ClimaRad) of remote","locale":"nl"},"1582":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-53","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"`37:`","locale":"nl"},"1583":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-54","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"CO₂-sensor / -bediening","locale":"nl"},"1584":{"id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors-55","page_id":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/nl/docs/remotes-and-sensors#adressen-herkennen","content":"De app kijkt niet alleen naar het voorvoegsel maar vooral naar **welke berichten** een apparaat verstuurt. De rol die\nhij zo bepaalt, zie je in de apparatenzoeker.","locale":"nl"},"1585":{"id":"/nl/docs/troubleshooting","page_id":"/nl/docs/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Problemen oplossen","breadcrumbs":["Documentatie","Hulp"],"tags":[],"url":"/nl/docs/troubleshooting","locale":"nl"},"1586":{"id":"/nl/docs/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/nl/docs/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/nl/docs/troubleshooting#problemen-oplossen","content":"Problemen oplossen","locale":"nl"},"1587":{"id":"/nl/docs/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/nl/docs/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"u